# Example /data/autoload.txt entry for the Y2JB Payload Manager.
# Lines are ELF paths, one per line. They are launched in order
# after kstuff Lite finishes setting up kernel access.
#
# Adjust the kstuff path to wherever you keep it on your console.

/data/kstuff.elf
/data/tostonsync/tostonsync.elf
